<div class="lead" style="margin-bottom: var(--space-2xl);">
  Project Broadsheet is maintained by one person in his spare time, but the documentation is thorough and the community is growing. Here's how to get help.
</div>

<section class="section-sm">
  <h2 class="h3">Start here</h2>
  <div class="grid grid-2" style="margin-top: var(--space-md);">
    <a class="card card--link" href="/docs/">
      <div class="card__eyebrow">Free · Self-serve</div>
      <h3 class="card__title">Read the docs</h3>
      <p class="card__summary">Eleven categories covering install, deployment, design, integrations, reader tools, migration, and troubleshooting. Search is always on.</p>
    </a>
    <a class="card card--link" href="{{ meta.github }}/discussions">
      <div class="card__eyebrow">Free · Community</div>
      <h3 class="card__title">GitHub Discussions</h3>
      <p class="card__summary">Ask questions, share publications, post feedback. Public, searchable, and open to everyone.</p>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-sm">
  <h2 class="h3">Report an issue</h2>
  <div class="grid grid-2" style="margin-top: var(--space-md);">
    <a class="card card--link" href="/forms/bug-report/">
      <div class="card__eyebrow">Free</div>
      <h3 class="card__title">Bug report</h3>
      <p class="card__summary">Something broken? Tell me what version, what browser, what you expected, and what happened.</p>
    </a>
    <a class="card card--link" href="/forms/feature-request/">
      <div class="card__eyebrow">Free</div>
      <h3 class="card__title">Feature request</h3>
      <p class="card__summary">Have an idea that would make Project Broadsheet better? Send it my way.</p>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-sm">
  <h2 class="h3">Paid support</h2>
  <p>Need hands-on help? I'm available to hire by the hour for troubleshooting, custom development, training, or anything else. See <a href="/pricing/">pricing</a> or <a href="/book-a-call/">book a call</a>.</p>
</section>

<section class="section-sm">
  <h2 class="h3">Funding</h2>
  <p>If Project Broadsheet saves you money or hours, consider chipping in. Contributions fund maintenance, new features, and documentation.</p>
  <div class="btn-group" style="margin-top: var(--space-md);">
    <a class="btn btn--outline" href="https://opencollective.com/broadsheet">Open Collective</a>
    <a class="btn btn--outline" href="https://github.com/sponsors/{{ meta.githubOwner }}">GitHub Sponsors</a>
  </div>
</section>
